---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 52
    messageMargin: 32
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Analyst
    participant UI as Alert workspace
    participant API as Investigation API
    participant Store as Evidence store
    participant XAI as Explanation service

    Analyst->>UI: Open a filtered alert
    UI->>API: Request alert detail
    API->>Store: Load evidence and feedback history
    Store-->>API: Alert evidence
    API-->>UI: Present investigation view

    opt analyst requests an explanation
        UI->>API: Request local explanation
        alt eligible ML alert
            API->>XAI: Compute local attributions
            XAI-->>API: Non-causal SHAP evidence
            API-->>UI: Present explanation evidence
        else explanation unavailable
            API-->>UI: Present explicit unavailability reason
        end
    end

    opt analyst records a disposition
        Analyst->>UI: Confirm status and justification
        UI->>API: Submit disposition
        API->>Store: Append feedback and update alert status
        Store-->>API: Saved feedback
        API-->>UI: Present updated alert
    end
